## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.6 Flash
- **Short description:** Google DeepMind fast-response model (2026) optimized for high-volume workloads with strong intelligence, multimodal capabilities, and competitive pricing.
- **Provider / access:** Google Vertex AI / Gemini API, Cloud AI Platform.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026; knowledge cutoff 2026.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3.6-flash`, `gemini-3.6-flash-latest`
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total tokens; 1,000,000 max output — standard for enterprise Gemini models.
- **Modalities:** text/image/video input; text output; reasoning yes; multimodal; JSON mode; extended context.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** $0.55 in / $1.65 out per 1M; cache $0.18 per 1M; highly competitive for high-volume use.
- **Architecture:** proprietary dense or mixture-of-experts; reasoning architecture; API-only.

